# Portfolio

A professional personal portfolio website.

## Overview
This is a static portfolio website designed to present skills, projects, and contact information in a clean and professional manner.

## Project Structure
- `index.html` — main webpage
- `styles.css` — site styling
- `script.js` — behavior and interactions
- `assets/` — images and media

## Local Development
```bash
python -m http.server 8000
```

## Deployment
Deploy as a static website on GitHub Pages, Netlify, or Vercel.

